# A click: a tap of MouseLeft, the minimum press included.
+north@0 -north@50
# A drag held by two bindings: the button goes down once and up with the last.
+south@200 +west@250 -south@300 -west@400
# A click during a drag does nothing: the button is down already, and a
# second press would be a double click.
+south@500 +north@520 -north@540 -south@700
# Shift+RButton as a hold: Shift is down around the button.
+east@800 -east@900
# Repeated clicks: a tap repeat clicks again every 100 ms while it is held.
+leftshoulder@1000 -leftshoulder@1320
# The trigger is still pulled when the trace ends: the exit lets go of XButton1.
lefttrigger=0.8@1500
